  "metadata": {
    "title": "2023 TIE-GCM Simulation Dataset for AFNO Inference Evaluation",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21859635",
    "publication_date": "2026-08-09",
    "description": "<p>This dataset contains the 2023 thermospheric simulation data generated using TIE-GCM and used for inference and evaluation of the trained AFNO model. The dataset provides the model inputs and corresponding TIE-GCM reference fields required to reproduce the simulation-based inference results reported in the associated study. These data are intended to support model reproducibility and validation against TIE-GCM simulations and should not be interpreted as independent observational validation. The dataset is released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license (CC BY 4.0).</p>",
